<title>UK: Wolstenholme sells unit to Lawter.</title>
<headline>Wolstenholme sells unit to Lawter.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wolstenholme Rink Plc said on Friday that it has agreed to sell the Resin Division of its subsidiary Wolstenholme International to Lawter International Inc. for 5.5 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>Lawter will also purchase the stocks of raw material, work in progress and finished goods at completion, which are estimated to be in the region of 1.7 million.</p>
<p>The printing materials manufacturer said the disposal will improve earnings per share and the cash proceeds will substantially reduce gearing.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
